Placeholder.

The UI kit's image assets were never copied into this repo (inherited from
markas-app-member). `pubspec.yaml` glob-registers this directory and
`AppImages` references files inside it, so the directory has to exist for
`flutter build` to bundle assets at all.

Screens that render these files (the kit's splash, onboarding and product
screens) will show a missing-asset error until the real files are restored
here. The seller screens added for the API integration are asset-free by
design and do not depend on this.
